"""
MorphSeq Pipeline - Snakemake Workflow

Contract-driven pipeline:
  - Extract physical scope metadata (scope-specific)
  - Build stitched FF images (scope-specific)
  - Materialize per-well frame_inventory (microscope-agnostic handoff)
  - Detect embryos per well (GroundingDINO → frame_detections)
  - frame_masks (segmentation) — SAM2 video per-well segmentation + merge
"""

